  <section class="ms-team__support" aria-label="How the Monroe team supports customers">
    <div class="ms-team__supportCard">
      <h3>Customer Support</h3>
      <p>Our customer service team helps customers with product questions, order support, and general assistance before and after purchase.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ms-team__supportCard">
      <h3>Operations &amp; Service</h3>
      <p>Our operations and warehouse service team helps keep orders, product support, and factory service needs moving efficiently.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ms-team__supportCard">
      <h3>Strategy &amp; Marketing</h3>
      <p>Our strategy and marketing team supports the website, customer resources, product information, and Monroe's overall digital presence.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ms-team__careers" aria-label="Careers at Monroe Systems for Business">
    <h3>Interested in Joining Monroe?</h3>
    <p>We're always on the lookout for passionate people to join our team. If you think you have something interesting to add, we'd love to hear about it.</p>
    <p>Send resumes and cover letters to <a href="mailto:csr@monroe-systems.com">csr@monroe-systems.com</a>.</p>
    <a class="ms-team__button" href="mailto:csr@monroe-systems.com">Contact Monroe</a>
